---

## 🎯 Key Features for Recruiters

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| **No Data Leakage** | `prepare_data()` splits first, then fits preprocessor on train only |
| **Production-Ready Preprocessing** | `ColumnTransformer` with `OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown='ignore')` |
| **Clean Architecture** | Separation of concerns: config, utils, preprocessing, models, CLI |
| **Comprehensive Testing** | 7 test modules covering config, utils, preprocessing, models, EDA, visuals, correlations |
| **CI/CD Pipeline** | GitHub Actions: lint → type-check → test → build on every push/PR |
| **Reproducible Environment** | Pinned `requirements.txt`, `pyproject.toml` with optional dependencies |
| **Professional CLI** | Typer-based commands with help, options, and subcommands |
| **Type Safety** | Full type hints, mypy strict mode compatible |

---

## 📚 Dataset

**IBM HR Analytics Employee Attrition Dataset**  
Source: [Kaggle](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/pavansubhasht/ibm-hr-analytics-attrition-dataset)  
- 1,470 records × 35 features
- Target: `Attrition` (Yes/No) — ~16% positive class
- Features: Demographics, job role, compensation, satisfaction, work-life balance

